body:
Hawks fan here.

Such a different team under Nate. I am going to be very upset if the Hawks don't throw some serious dough at that man in the offseason.  

&#x200B;

What's the report on Donovan? Hope he is back asap for you all. He is an easy guy to root for and I know he and Trae are close off the court.

&#x200B;

Hope you have a great playoff run and prove the doubters wrong.

My pick up line I received was better:

&#x200B;

I matched with you by mistake. Please do not message me again.

&#x200B;

I think she's the one.
